{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"effect":"ef_adv_08","eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story04","chara":[{"id":104401,"motion":300}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"小、小帆奈！@怎、怎么办啊！？","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":104401}],"nameCenter":"命","textBg":"shout","textCenter":"我好难受…！！@救、救救我…！！"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"我太勉强自己了","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"narration":"拜此所赐@灵魂宝石里积满了污秽…"},{"narration":"在这个小区的屋顶…@我逐渐变成了并非自己的其他存在"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21221.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"blackFrame"},{"chara":[{"id":301801}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","surround":"7006_cafe","textCenter":"你是不是在勉强自己…？@有时候你会露出很难受的表情哦？","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":301801}],"textClear":1},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"在去寻魔女之前@小帆奈如此对我说道","narrationBg":"narration","narrationCoverOpacity":160,"narrationEffect":"in","surround":"stop"},{"narration":"以前我邀请她来伪装的家里的时候@她也问过我是不是在勉强自己…@果然什么都瞒不过小帆奈呢"},{"narration":"呐，你其实已经什么都注意到了吗？@小帆奈其实都已经注意到了，@只是装作没有注意到而已吗…？"},{"narration":"到底是怎样呢…@事到如今，我也没办法确认了…"},{"autoTurnLast":1,"bg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":100,"pos":1}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"chara":[{"id":301801}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"濑奈！濑奈！","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"小帆奈独自陷入了慌乱@呼唤着我的名字…","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"narration":"因为自己的错@让小帆奈露出了那种表情@这让我非常难过"},{"narration":"反正都到最后了@我希望她能露出笑容"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"black","item":[{"path":"resource/scenario/img/31044_mikoto_story/memoria_1809.jpg","posX":0,"posY":0,"visible":"appear"}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"sepiaFrame"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"那时，我第一次感到@自己可以存在于这里","narrationBg":"narration","narrationCoverOpacity":160,"narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"是的，我想要存在于这里…@想要存在于这个神滨市、这个世界"},{"narration":"在生下了我的父母身边@与愿意和我说话的同学们一起@还有，和最好的朋友小帆奈一起…"},{"narration":"…我想和大家一起变得幸福"},{"narration":"但是我害怕受伤@所以逃进了别的世界"},{"narration":"我应该也能为爸爸妈妈做到些什么才对…@在固执认定他们不是真正的家人之前…@是啊…"},{"narration":"我应该打起勇气直面现实才对"},{"narration":"不该在同学们面前伪装自己@而是应该鼓起勇气显露出真正的自己才对"},{"narration":"也应该告诉小帆奈一切才对"},{"narration":"如果能靠自己踏出一步…@如果不那么害怕受伤@一切都能顺利发展下去才对"},{"narration":"…明明前段时间@我就已经明白了这些道理…"},{"narration":"为什么希望总是会背叛我呢…？"},{"autoTurnLast":0.5,"bg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","item":[{"path":"resource/scenario/img/31044_mikoto_story/memoria_1809.jpg","visible":"hide"}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"意识好像要被带走一样","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"从今往后我会变成什么样子呢？@虽然完全没有头绪…"},{"narration":"但是，我很清楚@今天的夕阳无比美丽"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"effect":"ef_adv_08","eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":300,"pos":1}],"narration":"啊啊…就算满是痛苦而悲伤的事情@世界看起来还是如此美丽…"},{"narration":"我以前到底都在看着什么…？@为什么没有想过去知晓@世界其实是这么美丽呢"},{"narration":"我真是个笨蛋…@什么都没想过去了解@就让爸爸消失了…"},{"narration":"会遭报应也是理所当然的"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":104401}],"nameCenter":"命","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"…小帆奈…！"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"但是，我心中充满了许多的感谢","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":100,"pos":1}],"narration":"真的充满了多到令我无所适从的@很多很多的感谢"},{"narration":"因为，小帆奈就在这里"},{"chara":[{"id":301801,"mouthOpen":1}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"濑奈——！"},{"nameNarration":"命","narration":"在小帆奈身后@夕阳正在闪闪发光","narrationBg":"bg_adv_17102.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":301801}],"narration":"那副景象实在是太过美丽@我不禁流下了眼泪","textClear":1},{"narration":"我很想告诉她这件事…"},{"autoTurnLast":1,"narrationEffect":"out"},{"autoTurnLast":2,"bg":"bg_adv_14063.jpg","bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":301801,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"whiteIn","turnChangeInTime":1.3},{"bgm":"bgm05_event06","chara":[{"id":301801,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"…………","turnChangeOut":"whiteOut","turnChangeOutTime":1.5},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":200,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"…好@…这样就差不多了吧？"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":301801}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_013.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":100,"pos":1,"posX":90}],"item":[{"path":"resource/scenario/img/31044_mikoto_story/31044_mikoto_penkan.png","posX":-90,"posY":0,"visible":"appear","zOrder":"charaBack"}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"…啊哈…@真是奇怪的圆珠笔…"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":301801}],"item":[{"path":"resource/scenario/img/31044_mikoto_story/31044_mikoto_penkan.png","visible":"hide"}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_014.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":400,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"濑奈，你听见了吗 ？@啊哈！肯定听不见吧"},{"chara":[{"id":301801,"motion":1}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"嘛，倒也无所谓啦—@总之呢—"},{"chara":[{"id":301801}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"那个时候@你到底想对我说什么"},{"chara":[{"id":301801}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"虽然只是靠感觉@但我全都理解了～"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":100}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"然后呢，我觉得啊"},{"chara":[{"id":301801}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"…希望你不要忘记那份心情"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_014.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":0}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"为什么呢—？@到底是为什么呢—？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":301801}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"…嘛，当然是因为@希望美丽的事物能一直保持美丽啊"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_013.exp3.json","id":301801,"motion":100}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"就是这样…啊哈…"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":301801,"lipSynch":0,"motion":1,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"…………"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":301801}]},{"chara":[{"id":301801}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"等着我，濑奈"},{"chara":[{"id":301801}],"nameCenter":"更纱帆奈","textCenter":"你真正想要的东西…"},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"textClear":1},{"autoTurnLast":1,"bg":"bg_adv_21173.jpg","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnChangeInTime":1},{"nameNarration":"更纱帆奈","narration":"我会在这里为你准备好的","narrationBg":"narration","narrationCoverOpacity":160,"narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut","turnChangeOutTime":1},{"autoTurnLast":3,"narrationEffect":"out"},{"autoTurnLast":2,"bg":"bg_adv_narration.jpg","bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":104401,"motion":1,"pos":1}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnChangeInTime":1.3,"turnEffect":"stop"},{"autoTurnFirst":4.5,"chara":[{"id":104401,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_1044_00_05"}],"nameCenter":"命","textCenter":"我真正想要的东西@到底是什么呢？","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":104401}]},{"autoTurnLast":2,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}